   "date": "11/12",
   "u": "https://t.me/V_Zelenskiy_official/21800",
   "t": {
    "ja": "占領地域でスターシールドの速度制限が時速161キロで再び現れ、ロシアのシャヘド型ドローンの迎撃に直接影響すると投稿した。",
    "en": "Zelensky posted that Starshield speed limits of 161 km/h have reappeared in occupied areas, directly affecting Ukraine's ability to intercept Russian jet-powered Shaheds.",
